Each work unit is atomic, has one owning stage/role, a precondition, an exact action, a
done-check, and the evidence it feeds.

### 2.0 Dependency graph

```
WU-0 (capability)
  └─▶ WU-1 (admit goals) ──┐
                           ├─▶ WU-3 (resolve SourceSet) ─▶ WU-4 (extract+score)
      WU-2 (freeze census)─┘                                        │
