**WU-2 must complete before WU-3 and WU-4.** This ordering is the probe's central integrity
property (§1 placement rationale): the denominator is fixed before any source is read for
content, so the extractor cannot self-select a field list that makes loss look small. WU-1 and
WU-3 read sources only for *admission* and *citation resolution*, never for scoring.

